 ### SCENARIO-PHASE4-029
 **Description:** Running Exp 4020 either writes `complete: goal_predicate_induced_heldout_precision_<p>` when the sandboxed predicate fires on every held-out solved state and on no held-out before-solve state, or writes `complete: goal_predicate_not_separable_<reason>` when the cached labels are insufficient or no restricted predicate separates train and held-out examples. A valid run MUST report `goal_predicate_heldout_precision` as a bare float, store the exact `goal_predicate_code` that Exp 4021 can execute, identify the selected game, count the observed level-up transitions, and declare an inference substrate that states cached artifacts were reused without a new exploration sweep.
+
+### REQ-PHASE4-030: ARC-AGI-3 Heuristic Search Over Verified World Model
+**Description:** The system SHALL run Exp 4021 as a bounded heuristic-search planning layer over an already verifier-certified ARC-AGI-3 world model, preferring the `r11l` L4 wall or `vc33`. It MUST reuse the existing verified transition simulator and the Exp 4020 sandboxed `is_goal(state)` predicate without fresh rule induction, order frontier expansion with a coded heuristic such as unmet goal components plus Manhattan/progress distance, bound node expansions to at most 50000, and execute any claimed solution in the real offline environment with `levels_completed` confirmation. The terminal artifact `results/experiment_4021_heuristic_search_over_verified_wm.json` MUST include bare fields `honest_verdict`, `new_levels_solved_this_task`, `wall_was_search_not_representation`, `nodes_expanded`, `heuristic_used`, `real_env_confirmed`, and `inference_substrate`.
+
+### SCENARIO-PHASE4-030
+**Description:** Running Exp 4021 either writes `complete: search_layer_solved_<game>_L<k>_real_env_confirmed` when the search plan advances beyond the prior single-step re-induction wall and the real environment confirms `levels_completed`, or writes `complete: search_layer_no_solve_<game>_L<k>_<bottleneck>` when the bounded search exhausts or hits a simulator/action-space bottleneck. A valid artifact MUST report whether search advanced past the prior stall, whether the wall was search rather than representation, the exact expansion count, the coded heuristic string, the real-env confirmation boolean, and the inference substrate used for the planner.
